A cognitive beacon is a metal stake driven into the ground with a brazier at its head. Lit, it forms a two-way link between the spot where it stands and the ship that sent the bearer, and it carries the bearer back aboard. Where a barrier or the [[Phenomena/The Slip|slip]] keeps a ship out, a beacon planted beyond it lets the ship reach through and take what it wants.

[[Org/Sedecium|Sedecium]] hands them out on a hurried mission as a metal stake that unfolds; the technology is old enough that nobody has seen a reason to change it. The same device has been used elsewhere to send a thing ahead to a place it could not otherwise reach.
